OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M5 after lorry
OL,4,Aoverturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on the M5
OL,7,Ffollowing a closure due to an
OL,8,Foverturned lorry.
OL,10,FAll three lanes were closed on the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway at the Huntworth
OL,12,FBridge at Bridgwater in Somerset, just
OL,13,Fafter junction 24.
OL,15,FThe vehicle has now been recovered and
OL,16,Fall lanes have reopened. Avon and
OL,17,FSomerset Police said no injuries had
OL,18,Fbeen reported.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
