OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M5 after lorry
OL,4,Aoverturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said drivers were
OL,7,Fstill facing delays, with nine miles
OL,8,F(14.5km) of traffic on the approach.
OL,9,FCongestion remains on surrounding
OL,10,Froads.
